          <!-- ───────────────────────────────────────── [07] Agents and four moves -->
          <section class="agents" id="agents" aria-labelledby="agents-title">
            <div class="head">
              <div class="head__main">
                <p class="tag">[07] Agents</p>
                <h2 id="agents-title" class="h2" data-reveal>Bring the agents you already have.</h2>
              </div>
              <p class="body head__aside" data-reveal>
                Astrolabe drives the coding agents on your computer, signed in with your own accounts. Your
                code goes to the provider you chose, the same as running its command line yourself. Switch
                agents between turns; the thread notes each handoff.
              </p>
            </div>

            <ol class="moves" data-moves>
              <li class="move" id="move-fork">
                <div class="move__sim sim" data-sim>
                  <svg class="sf" viewBox="0 0 400 240" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path class="sf-main" pathLength="1" d="M28 150H372" />
                    <circle class="sf-n" style="--d: 0.25s" cx="84" cy="150" r="6" />
                    <circle class="sf-n" style="--d: 0.45s" cx="152" cy="150" r="6" />
                    <circle class="sf-n" style="--d: 0.65s" cx="220" cy="150" r="6" />
                    <circle class="sf-n" style="--d: 0.85s" cx="300" cy="150" r="6" />
                    <circle class="sf-ring" pathLength="1" cx="220" cy="150" r="14" />
                    <text class="sf-t" x="220" y="190" text-anchor="middle">cp 3</text>
                    <path class="sf-branch" pathLength="1" d="M220 150C262 150 254 78 298 78H352" />
                    <circle class="sf-n" style="--d: 1.75s" cx="310" cy="78" r="6" />
                    <circle class="sf-head" cx="352" cy="78" r="6" />
                    <g class="sf-tag">
                      <rect x="262" y="34" width="110" height="24" />
                      <text x="317" y="50" text-anchor="middle">New thread</text>
                    </g>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="move__cap">
                  <p class="tag">[01]</p>
                  <h3 class="move__verb">Fork</h3>
                  <p>Nothing runs until you send the fork its first message, so you can open one before you decide to use it.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="move" id="move-run">
                <div class="move__sim sim sim--run" data-sim aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="sr">
                    <p class="sr__head"><span>Codex</span><span class="sr__done">Done</span></p>
                    <p class="sr__line" style="--n: 12; --d: 0.2s">Read 6 files</p>
                    <p class="sr__line" style="--n: 22; --d: 0.7s">Edited ledger/round.ts <b>+42</b></p>
                    <p class="sr__line" style="--n: 25; --d: 1.25s">Edited invoices/total.ts <b>+6</b></p>
                    <p class="sr__line" style="--n: 20; --d: 1.85s">Ran pnpm test ledger</p>
                    <p class="sr__foot">Branch ledger-rounding</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="sr">
                    <p class="sr__head"><span>Claude Code</span><span class="sr__live"><i></i>Working</span></p>
                    <p class="sr__line" style="--n: 12; --d: 0.45s">Read 4 files</p>
                    <p class="sr__line" style="--n: 24; --d: 0.95s">Edited invoices/round.ts <b>+31</b></p>
                    <p class="sr__line" style="--n: 23; --d: 1.55s">Edited round.test.ts <b>+58</b></p>
                    <p class="sr__line" style="--n: 21; --d: 2.1s">Running pnpm test …</p>
                    <p class="sr__foot">Branch edge-rounding</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="move__cap">
                  <p class="tag">[02]</p>
                  <h3 class="move__verb">Run</h3>
                  <p>Each fork shows its own status in the sidebar, working or waiting for you, and its agent in the composer.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="move" id="move-compare">
                <div class="move__sim sim sim--cmp" data-sim aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="sc">
                    <p class="sc__head">Codex · ledger</p>
                    <p class="sc__row sc__row--del" style="--d: 0.15s"><i>−</i>round(item.amount)</p>
                    <p class="sc__row" style="--d: 0.3s"><i>+</i>const exact = sum(items)</p>
                    <p class="sc__row sc__row--key" style="--d: 0.45s"><i>+</i>roundMinor(exact, currency)</p>
                    <p class="sc__foot">ledger/src/round.ts · idle</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="sc">
                    <p class="sc__head">Claude Code · invoices</p>
                    <p class="sc__row sc__row--del" style="--d: 0.25s"><i>−</i>round(item.amount)</p>
                    <p class="sc__row" style="--d: 0.4s"><i>+</i>const step = currency.step</p>
                    <p class="sc__row sc__row--key" style="--d: 0.55s"><i>+</i>roundTo(line, step)</p>
                    <p class="sc__foot">invoices/src/round.ts · working</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="move__cap">
                  <p class="tag">[03]</p>
                  <h3 class="move__verb">Compare</h3>
                  <p>Open the forks as chat tabs with a diff beside each, and choose on what actually changed.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="move" id="move-keep">
                <div class="move__sim sim sim--keep" data-sim aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="sk">
                    <p class="sk__crumb">Wiki · engineering</p>
                    <p class="sk__title">Rounding</p>
                    <p class="sk__bar" style="--w: 94%"></p>
                    <p class="sk__bar" style="--w: 80%"></p>
                    <p class="sk__new"><span>Rounding happens once, in the ledger, using half to even.</span></p>
                    <p class="sk__bar" style="--w: 88%"></p>
                    <p class="sk__bar" style="--w: 56%"></p>
                    <p class="sk__merged">Merged</p>
                  </div>
                  <p class="sk__note"><span>From “Ledger owns rounding”</span>Rounding happens once, in the ledger, using half to even.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="move__cap">
                  <p class="tag">[04]</p>
                  <h3 class="move__verb">Keep</h3>
                  <p>The kept fork comes back as a summary. What should outlast the thread goes to the wiki, as an amendment you approve.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>
            <div class="pager" data-pager hidden>
              <button type="button" aria-label="Fork" aria-current="true"></button>
              <button type="button" aria-label="Run"></button>
              <button type="button" aria-label="Compare"></button>
              <button type="button" aria-label="Keep"></button>
            </div>
          </section>
